	(text "- let's fire these LEDs digitally (more reliable, more control, more future-proof)\n- we are going to use a low-side switch circuit ( to switch the negative side of the LED to GND) using an ESP digital pin and an n-channel mosfet\nto act as an inverter. \n- when we write a digital HIGH to the pin, the n-mosfet will close the source (GND) and drain (LED_NEG) to close the circuit, and power the LED"
